  "summary": "Completed the document-first export contract and executable adoption plan. Plite owns pure authored projection and neutral structural text traversal; Plate format owners expose projection-aware document serializers with one data-and-diagnostics result shape; static rendering uses a private read-only projected view without editing lifecycle activation; and DOCX retains its hybrid backend while required Word semantics move out of the copied UI kit. The plan rejects a universal ExportPlugin, public compiler object and all-format Plite package. No product implementation is claimed.",
